{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Project Re:VOLVE: A lighthearted, sometimes serious, and comedic RPG, Platformer, and Bullet Hell Hybrid about a HUMAN that accidentally finds their way into the World of SPIRITS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>&quot;Let me tell you a story that is as old as time... A story of HUMANS, a story of SPIRITS, and a story of EVERYTHING IN BETWEEN...&quot;</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After getting lost within the depths of a cavern, you uncover a large and mysterious book written in a language you cannot understand. Upon opening it, a wolf SPIRIT is released from the book, while also placing the books curse onto you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together, the two of you must embark on a journey throughout the <strong>THREE KINGDOMS </strong>within <i><strong>The Outer Ring of The Re:VOLVE</strong>. </i>You may choose to SAVE these <i><strong>THREE KINGDOMS</strong></i> from the <strong>DARKNESS</strong><i>, or</i> you may become part of the <strong>DARKNESS </strong>itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Features:</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~ A collection of ever-growing episodes for the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~ 3 unique battle systems (Music based, combat based, and turn-based)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~ A top-down pixel art JRPG style for a majority of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~ Platforming stages and balance-based movement systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~ An evolving difficulty system based on player performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~ A quickly growing soundtrack made entirely by the developer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~ A story where your choices matter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~ A plethora of endings per episode depending on your actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~ Window-breaking mechanics shattering the veil between your world and the OTHERWORLD.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4049450?t=1759447242","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4049450?t=1759447242","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049450/ca97ccd3fc8ff72430515bc3525252cce7246e65/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759447242","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049450/ca97ccd3fc8ff72430515bc3525252cce7246e65/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759447242","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Project Re:VOLVE: A lighthearted, sometimes serious, and comedic RPG, Platformer, and Bullet Hell Hybrid about a HUMAN that accidentally finds their way into the World of SPIRITS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>&quot;Let me tell you a story that is as old as time... A story of HUMANS, a story of SPIRITS, and a story of EVERYTHING IN BETWEEN...&quot;</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After getting lost within the depths of a cavern, you uncover a large and mysterious book written in a language you cannot understand. Upon opening it, a wolf SPIRIT is released from the book, while also placing the books curse onto you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together, the two of you must embark on a journey throughout the <strong>THREE KINGDOMS </strong>within <i><strong>The Outer Ring of The Re:VOLVE</strong>. </i>You may choose to SAVE these <i><s